# ── Medical imaging data: NEVER commit ──────────────────────
# Keep datasets OUTSIDE the repository when possible. If you must keep them
# inside the project folder, put them under data/ or datasets/.
# Folder patterns are anchored to the repo root (leading "/") so they never
# match source folders such as src/dicom/ (macOS paths are case-insensitive).
/data/
/datasets/
/public/sample/
/dicom-data/
/TCIA/
/RIDER*/
/LIDC*/
/manifest-*/
*.dcm
*.DCM
*.dicom
*.ima
*.IMA
DICOMDIR
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.nrrd
*.mha
*.mhd
*.raw
*.tcia
*.zip

# compiled evaluation build (npm run eval)
/.eval-build/

# evaluation cache (re-creatable)
/docs/eval/cache/
